# vantablack — true black, greys (dark), from omarchy's vantablack theme.
#
# Upstream: https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy  themes/vantablack/colors.toml  (df3d01c)
# Licence:  MIT, Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson
#
# Colours only; omarchy's wallpapers and images are not used. The mapping onto
# Ergon's 22 roles is ours, the same for every omarchy palette: BG0 background,
# BG1/BG2 the raised surfaces (lighter_background and selection; the darker
# step for a light ground), FG0 bright_foreground, FG1 foreground, DIM
# light_foreground, DIMMER dark_foreground, the ramp cyan/blue/magenta/yellow/
# red, HOT_* and BLUSH their bright_ forms, ACCENT blue, ACTIVE omarchy's accent.
# Greys only, by design: URGENT and WARN differ from the text by lightness alone.

COOL_BG0=#000000
COOL_BG1=#1A1A1A
COOL_BG2=#7A7A7A
COOL_FG0=#FFFFFF
COOL_FG1=#FFFFFF
COOL_DIM=#ECECEC
COOL_DIMMER=#505050
COOL_0=#B0B0B0
COOL_1=#8D8D8D
COOL_2=#9B9B9B
COOL_3=#CECECE
COOL_4=#A4A4A4
COOL_HOT_0=#B0B0B0
COOL_HOT_4=#A4A4A4
COOL_MINT=#B6B6B6
COOL_BLUSH=#9B9B9B
COOL_ACCENT=#8D8D8D
COOL_ACTIVE=#8D8D8D
COOL_URGENT=#A4A4A4
COOL_WARN=#CECECE
COOL_GOOD=#B6B6B6
COOL_INACTIVE=#7A7A7A
